D2a PASS: dP/drho = (q + 1) P/rho > 0 <=> -1 < q
D2b PASS: N^2 = dlnP*g*(-gamma + q + 1)/(gamma*(q + 1)); isothermal (q=0, per-system) stable iff gamma > 1; barotropic: gamma=5/3 -> (-1 < q) & (q < 2/3); gamma=4/3 -> (-1 < q) & (q < 1/3)
